<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Feb CPI up 2.2pct mth/mth, 18.8pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary Feb CPI up 2.2pct mth/mth, 18.8pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's February consumer price index (CPI) rose 2.2 percent, compared with January's 3.7-percent jump, to an 18.8-percent year-on-year rise, the Central Statistical Office said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
